  "notes": "selfoss RSS reader. Content area has a subtle diagonal crosshatch texture; each entry row has a teal left border marking unread (read rows lose it and title turns grey). Tag labels are small saturated colour-coded pills (colours user-configurable per tag via swatches in sidebar). Sources show tiny favicon-like letter squares. Expanded entry body flows into 3 CSS columns with vertical rules and an action bar (Star, Mark as read, Open, share icons for Twitter/Facebook/Pocket/Diaspora/email). Unread count badge in red with cloud icon. URL updates to the open entry id."
